# CrazyGames publishing

The index is `docs/crazygames.md`. Answer publish questions from that file. Do not re-fetch docs.crazygames.com unless the index has no page for the question.

Roadkeep resubmit (settled):

- No ads. Do not add ad calls. A disabled ad that freezes play is a rejection.
- Instant multiplayer is not required while solo play exists. Full Launch only if multiplayer stays.
- iOS and Android already play smoothly. Do not retest unless a change touches input.
- CrazyGames mode is a `crazygames.com` host or `?portal=crazygames`.
- Upload `C:\Users\user\projects\roadkeep-main\roadkeep-crazygames.zip` from `npm run build:portal` (`index.html` at the zip root, relative base `./`). Do not rebuild it for a docs-only change.
- Preview: `https://ka9krew.github.io/roadkeep/?portal=crazygames`. Do not submit the itch.io URL. GitHub Pages base stays `/roadkeep/`.
- SDK must not load on GitHub Pages and must not call ads.

Tags in the index: Basic, Full, Portal, Guideline, Invite, Legacy.
